 "remarks": "Enjoy this duplex with the space and feel of a single-family home with all the amenities of downtown New Canaan in close proximity, including the train, shops and restaurants! The updated kitchen features granite counters, stainless steel appliances and sliders to a private deck. The stunning living room showcases hardwood floors, Palladian windows, soaring ceilings, skylights and exposed brick. A separate dining room with a fireplace and access to a terrace adds to the home's charm. The primary bedroom features a newly renovated en-suite bath, complemented by two additional spacious bedrooms and three full baths in total. The finished walk-out lower level offers a family room, bonus space ideal for an office or guest area, a full bath and a private entrance. An attached garage adds everyday convenience, while nearby highly regarded schools enhance the location. Available for a six-month rental with an option to renew.",
